    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About &quot;uDesktopMascot&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;uDesktopMascot&quot;</strong> is a highly customizable desktop mascot application that brings freedom and personality to your desktop. Users can create their own unique desktop environment by adding files and changing settings to suit their preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463150/extras/472adee857e7f3a4fd020df3a3159cce.avif?t=1746234519\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Character Models</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load 3D models in VRM, GLB, and GLTF formats to freely change the appearance of your mascot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your favorite characters or original models on your desktop</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Voice Settings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace the character's voice for startup, shutdown, and when the character is tapped</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set original audio files to make your mascot more familiar and personalized</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the mascot's position and size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for multi-display setups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune settings for transparency and display state</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to customize their desktop to reflect their personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who wish to feel closer to their favorite characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to enliven their desktop with 3D models</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your very own desktop mascot with &quot;uDesktopMascot&quot;!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About &quot;uDesktopMascot&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;uDesktopMascot&quot;</strong> is a highly customizable desktop mascot application that brings freedom and personality to your desktop. Users can create their own unique desktop environment by adding files and changing settings to suit their preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463150/extras/472adee857e7f3a4fd020df3a3159cce.avif?t=1746234519\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Character Models</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load 3D models in VRM, GLB, and GLTF formats to freely change the appearance of your mascot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your favorite characters or original models on your desktop</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Voice Settings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace the character's voice for startup, shutdown, and when the character is tapped</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set original audio files to make your mascot more familiar and personalized</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the mascot's position and size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for multi-display setups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune settings for transparency and display state</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to customize their desktop to reflect their personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who wish to feel closer to their favorite characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to enliven their desktop with 3D models</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your very own desktop mascot with &quot;uDesktopMascot&quot;!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;uDesktopMascot&quot; lets you customize your desktop mascot: Add Models: Import models in VRM , GLB, and GLTF formats from folders. Set BGM: Add music files to the BGM folder. Customize Voices: Add voice files for startup, shutdown, and tapping interactions. AI Chat",
